# trading_pulse Python

- Small, focused diffs; match existing module style.
- User-facing Telegram strings → `telegram_format.py` + HTML (`escape_html`), not raw prints in jobs.
- After UX/command changes: `@trading-pulse-bot-messages` and/or `@trading-pulse-guide-updater`.
- After behavior changes: `@trading-pulse-test-writer` then `@trading-pulse-verifier`.
- Restart app for code changes: `.\scripts\run_app.ps1` (quit tray first).
- Do not hardcode secrets; read from config / env via existing helpers.
